<title>CHINA: Trading in Whimsy shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Whimsy shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Whimsy Entertainment Co Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shares of the amusement centre operator ended unchanged at HK$1.65 on Monday on volume of 582,000 shares.</p>
<p>Last month, Yaohan International Holdings Ltd said it was in talks to sell part or its entire 35.23 percent stake in Whimsy to parties including First Shanghai Investment Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
